{"title":"Spring Cloud Gateway","uid":"a21e29447976a2a94b897b498ecbb6d5","slug":"网关/Spring-Cloud-Gateway","date":"2025-02-09T13:25:22.000Z","updated":"2025-03-31T09:53:04.796Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/网关/Spring-Cloud-Gateway.json","keywords":null,"cover":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"重要属性\"><a href=\"#重要属性\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"重要属性\"></a>重要属性</h2><ol>\n<li>GATEWAY_ORIGINAL_REQUEST_URL_ATTR</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>记录原始的url请求</li>\n<li>错误重试时可以用原始URI重试</li>\n<li>可以记录完整的请求转换链路</li>\n<li>故障分析时可以知道请求的来源</li>\n<li>在路由重写时需要更新此属性</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>GATEWAY_REQUEST_URL_ATTR</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>存储请求将要转发的目标URL</li>\n<li>后续的过滤器和路由可以通过这个属性知道请求要被转发到哪里</li>\n<li>在路由重写时需要更新此属性</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>PRESERVE_HOST_HEADER_ATTRIBUTE</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>控制是否保留原始请求的 Host 头</li>\n<li>true: 转发请求时会保留客户端的原始 Host header</li>\n<li>false: 会使用目标服务的 Host</li>\n<li>使用场景：假设自定义的过滤器修改了host属性，如果没有开启此配置，那么后续的处理可能影响此属性，这时候需要开启此配置</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"重要过滤器\"><a href=\"#重要过滤器\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"重要过滤器\"></a>重要过滤器</h2><ol>\n<li><p>RetryGatewayFilterFactory</p>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>重试过滤器</p></blockquote>\n <figure class=\"shiki java\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre class=\"shiki material-theme-palenight\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">-</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> name</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF; font-style: italic\">:</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> Retry #重试策略</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF; font-style: italic\">:</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">目前只对提供者下线导致的连接异常重试，需持续观察异常情况</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">  args</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF; font-style: italic\">:</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    retries</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF; font-style: italic\">:</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #F78C6C\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    series</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF; font-style: italic\">:</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> #不对http状态来判断是否进行重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    exceptions</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF; font-style: italic\">:</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> io</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">.</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">netty</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">.</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">channel</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">.</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">AbstractChannel$AnnotatedConnectException</span></span></code></pre></div></div></figure></li>\n</ol>\n","text":"重要属性 GATEWAY_ORIGINAL_REQUEST_URL_ATTR 记录原始的url请求 错误重试时可以用原始URI重试 可以记录完整的请求转换链路 ...","permalink":"/post/网关/Spring-Cloud-Gateway","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":600,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"网关","slug":"网关","count":1,"path":"api/categories/网关.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"网关","slug":"网关","count":1,"path":"api/tags/网关.json"},{"name":"spring cloud gateway","slug":"spring-cloud-gateway","count":1,"path":"api/tags/spring-cloud-gateway.json"},{"name":"spring cloud","slug":"spring-cloud","count":1,"path":"api/tags/spring-cloud.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7\"><span class=\"toc-text\">重要属性</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E8%BF%87%E6%BB%A4%E5%99%A8\"><span class=\"toc-text\">重要过滤器</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/","description":"Code & Life <br> 道阻且长，行则将至","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/taeyang0126","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"JVM内存相关的监控指标","uid":"627b28a34c03ff4a0ad0cf57ac49d90a","slug":"jvm/JVM内存相关的监控指标","date":"2025-02-09T13:53:30.000Z","updated":"2025-0